@rag = http://localhost:5070
# Paste a fresh token from the CoreAPI login: raw value only, no quotes, no "Bearer".
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 0. Health (no token needed)
GET {{rag}}/health

### 1. Upload a vendor agreement PDF (change vendorId and the file path)
POST {{rag}}/api/v1/vendor-agreements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----RagBoundary

------RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="vendorId"

1
------RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Supply agreement 2026
------RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="agreement.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\agreement.pdf
------RagBoundary--

### 2. List agreements of the vendor
GET {{rag}}/api/v1/vendor-agreements?vendorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Extract the payment terms (uses the chat model - the slow step). Use the agreement id from step 1.
POST {{rag}}/api/v1/vendor-agreements/1/extract-terms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Read the terms back
GET {{rag}}/api/v1/vendor-agreements/1/terms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4b. Retrieval only: which clauses/pages does the search find? (fast, no chat model)
POST {{rag}}/api/v1/rag/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "late payment penalty interest", "vendorId": 1, "topK": 5 }

### 5. Ask about a vendor (no PO)
POST {{rag}}/api/v1/rag/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What are the payment terms and the penalty for late payment?", "vendorId": 1 }

### 6. Ask about a purchase order (PO facts + agreement + computed due date/penalty)
POST {{rag}}/api/v1/rag/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When is payment due for this PO and what penalty applies if we pay late?", "poNumber": "PO-0001" }

### 7. Payment summary for a PO (no language model, pure calculation)
GET {{rag}}/api/v1/rag/po/PO-0001/payment-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
